# 6) Where an LLM *does* help (kept off the trade path)

* Auto-generated **post-trade notes**: “Why did we enter? What failed? What improved risk?”
* **Weekly review**: summarize which strategies added PnL and which underperformed.
* **Anomaly triage**: “Volume engine output missing for 2 cycles; likely data provider outage.”

All of this improves observability without touching the actual execute/no-execute decision.

